            "id": 2881657,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Now turn to Section four. Section four You will hear part of a lecture on an environmental studies course about recent research on how animals are adapting to urban environments. First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.",
