                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2882361,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "But on the other hand, it's possible that not all of these adaptations will be permanent. Once the animal's got accustomed to its new environment, it may no longer need the features it's developed. So now we've had a look at adaptation",
